The expression `$.orders[*].customer.email` uses **JSONPath** syntax to navigate the data structure. It selects every element within the `orders` array, moves into the `customer` object, and retrieves the `email` field.

```json
{
  "orders": [
    { "customer": { "email": "user1@example.com" } },
    { "customer": { "email": "user2@example.com" } }
  ]
}
```
